 arch/s390/kvm/sigp.c                 | 2 +-
 arch/s390/kvm/vsie.c                 | 2 +-
 15 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
 rename arch/s390/kvm/{kvm-s390.c => s390.c} (99%)
 rename arch/s390/kvm/{kvm-s390.h => s390.h} (99%)

